et_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/17.0.2\/svg\/1f525.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd25\" \/>\u00a0GIRAS<\/strong><\/h4><ul style=\"text-align: center;\"><li style=\"text-align: left;\">Para passar em atendimento o assunto deve ser <strong>previamente comunicado para a Maria<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>\u3164<\/p><h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/17.0.2\/svg\/1f4b5.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udcb5\" \/> PAGAMENTOS<\/strong><\/h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Os m\u00e9diuns s\u00e3o respons\u00e1veis pelo pagamento dos<\/p><ul style=\"text-align: center;\"><li style=\"text-align: left;\">Materiais da casa<\/li><li style=\"text-align: left;\">Firmezas e materiais de rituais<\/li><li style=\"text-align: left;\">Limpeza e manuten\u00e7\u00e3o<\/li><\/ul><p>\u3164<\/p><h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/17.0.2\/svg\/1f6e0.svg\" alt=\"\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\" \/> MANUTEN\u00c7\u00c3O<\/strong><\/h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Aqueles que fazem atividades de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>N\u00c3O entram no rateio<\/strong> daquela atividade pois j\u00e1 contribu\u00edram com seu tempo<\/p><ul style=\"text-align: center;\"><li style=\"text-align: left;\">Limpeza<\/li><li style=\"text-align: left;\">Compra grande de materiais<\/li><li style=\"text-align: left;\">Idas ao CEASA (<strong>2 isen\u00e7\u00f5es<\/strong>)\u00b9<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49d374b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"49d374b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">1. O ceasa por ser um trabalho mais exigente tem duas isen\u00e7\u00f5es, ou seja, se 2 pessoas forem, as 2 n\u00e3o entram no rateio. <\/span><\/p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">Se uma pessoa for sozinha, ela ganha o cr\u00e9dito de 2 isen\u00e7\u00f5es.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">Se mais de 2 pessoas forem, elas repartem as 2 isen\u00e7\u00f5es entre si e abatem o valor.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1991\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1991\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> \ud83d\udcb0 Financeiro <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-up\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M177 159.7l136 136c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L160 255.9l-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 329.7c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l136-136c9.4-9.5 24.6-9.5 34-.1z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-down\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/sp