       \n  <\/div>\n  \n  <div id=\"uc_uc_icon_accordion_elementor_6b60d55_item2-content\" class=\"uc_content\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"uc_uc_icon_accordion_elementor_6b60d55_item2-title\" >\n          <h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>SETORES<\/strong><\/h4><p>A feira \u00e9 organizada em 3 setores<\/p><ul><li>Acess\u00f3rios e Artesanato<\/li><li>Plantas Ornamentais e Vasos<\/li><li><strong>Flores e Folhas de Corte<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p><a href=\"https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp1.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-258 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"870\" height=\"675\" srcset=\"https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp1.png 870w, https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp1-300x233.png 300w, https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp1-768x596.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 870px) 100vw, 870px\" \/><\/a><\/p><p>A <strong>primeira metade<\/strong> da feira \u00e9 onde geralmente compramos tudo, na parte das <strong>flores e folhas de corte<\/strong>.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>NUMERA\u00c7\u00c3O<\/strong><\/h4><p>Voc\u00ea pode se localizar tamb\u00e9m pela numera\u00e7\u00e3o na parte de cima da feira<\/p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-254\" src=\"https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/NUMERACAO-300x169.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/NUMERACAO-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/NUMERACAO-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/NUMERACAO.png 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><p>Ela vai de <strong>240 a 0 do lado esquerdo <\/strong>da feira e o contr\u00e1rio do lado direito.<\/p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-259 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"870\" height=\"675\" srcset=\"https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp2.png 870w, https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp2-300x233.png 300w, https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp2-768x596.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 870px) 100vw, 870px\" \/><\/p><p>Costumamos comprar flores e ervas pr\u00f3ximas aos <strong>n\u00fameros 177 e 127 (do lado esquerdo)<\/strong><\/p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-260 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"870\" height=\"675\" srcset=\"https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp3.png 870w, https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp3-300x233.png 300w, https:\/\/cointa.lksventura.com.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ceagesp3-768x596.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 870px) 100vw, 870px\" \/><\/p><p>Mais especificamente, nos m\u00f3dulos <strong>n\u00ba 378\/379<\/strong> e <strong>n\u00ba 322<\/strong><\/p>\n     \n    \n     \n    \n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div id=\"uc_uc_icon_accordion_elementor_6b60d55_item3\" class=\"uc_ac_box  elementor-repeater-item-ac7ff23\">\n  <div class=\"uc-heading uc_trigger\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"uc_uc_icon_accordion_elementor_6b60d55_item3-content\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    \n          <div class=\"ue_icon_holder\">\n        <div class=\"ue_icon\"><i class='fas fa-coins'><\/i><\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ue_icon_spacing\"><\/div>\n        \n    <div id=\"uc_uc_icon_accordion_elementor_6